    "description": {
      "value": "This silver signet ring changes to match the insignia of a lord or organization you serve (or your own face, if you serve no one else). It grants you a +2 item bonus to Diplomacy checks and lets you cast message as an arcane innate spell at will. The ring casts animal messenger to your specification. The animal is a magical creature that springs from the ring, and its appearance suits the iconography or heraldry of the lord or organization represented by the ring. The ring grants a +3 bonus and can be activated in an additional way. Activate 3 command; Frequency once per hour; Effect The ring casts sending to your specifications."
